WEBVTT

01:29.300 --> 01:34.340
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.759 --> 01:37.780
[Episode 27]

01:44.770 --> 01:45.360
Zhou Wan.

01:46.330 --> 01:47.410
So you're after

01:47.410 --> 01:48.670
Lu Zhongyue all along.

01:58.360 --> 01:58.930
For tomorrow's

01:58.930 --> 02:00.210
meeting on independent IP,

02:00.210 --> 02:01.280
I've preselected

02:01.280 --> 02:02.520
some suitable companies.

02:02.520 --> 02:03.580
Please take a look.

02:05.640 --> 02:06.970
What did you promise me?

02:11.290 --> 02:14.010
No work at home.

02:14.840 --> 02:15.770
Have some jelly.

02:17.329 --> 02:18.329
Don't be mad.

02:21.410 --> 02:22.230
That's it?

02:23.240 --> 02:23.770
I don't buy it.

02:23.770 --> 02:24.570
One more bite.

02:28.930 --> 02:29.610
Not enough.

02:35.050 --> 02:36.050
Still not enough.

02:41.280 --> 02:42.280
Still not enough.

02:46.290 --> 02:47.090
How about now?

02:47.520 --> 02:48.320
How about now?

02:49.079 --> 02:50.110
How about now?

02:50.440 --> 02:55.440
[Konjac jelly]

02:51.640 --> 02:52.440
How about now?

02:52.490 --> 02:53.050
What are you doing?

02:53.050 --> 02:53.850
How about now?

02:54.290 --> 02:54.770
How about now?

02:54.770 --> 02:55.290
You...

02:58.530 --> 02:59.960
[Independent IP Strategy Overview]

02:59.079 --> 03:00.050
I want to build

03:00.050 --> 03:01.360
Lan Yue's own

03:00.100 --> 03:09.160
[Partner Selection Criteria]

03:01.360 --> 03:02.020
IP.

03:02.730 --> 03:03.450
But

03:04.320 --> 03:05.080
we have

03:05.080 --> 03:06.740
zero experience in this area,

03:06.970 --> 03:08.400
so we can't just jump in blindly.

03:08.400 --> 03:09.120
We need to

03:09.120 --> 03:10.240
find a partner

03:10.240 --> 03:11.680
with relevant

03:11.680 --> 03:12.410
experience.

03:13.170 --> 03:14.610
After you raised this,

03:14.610 --> 03:15.610
I looked into

03:15.610 --> 03:17.240
all the companies in this space.

03:17.240 --> 03:18.520
One that fits our needs

03:18.520 --> 03:19.360
and has experience managing

03:19.360 --> 03:20.050
large IP portfolios.

03:20.050 --> 03:21.579
There's one stood out to me.

03:21.590 --> 03:22.240
[Core Competencies Analysis]

03:22.340 --> 03:23.920
[Shengshi Huayu
IP Development Capabilities]

03:22.490 --> 03:23.420
Shengshi Huayu.

03:26.079 --> 03:27.480
That's exactly the one I want.

03:27.480 --> 03:29.130
No, wait, X-Xixiao.

03:29.520 --> 03:31.170
Shengshi Huayu

03:31.200 --> 03:32.800
shut down all

03:32.800 --> 03:34.329
its theme parks a few years ago.

03:34.329 --> 03:35.520
Rumor has it

03:34.460 --> 03:38.040
[Shengshi Huayu
IP Development Capabilities]

03:35.520 --> 03:36.610
there's a problem with the operation.

03:36.610 --> 03:37.540
-Yes.
-No, wait.

03:37.730 --> 03:38.360
I've heard

03:38.360 --> 03:39.329
there's more to it than that.

03:39.329 --> 03:41.120
But we won't know

03:41.120 --> 03:42.850
the details until we reach out.

03:44.360 --> 03:44.930
Xin.

03:45.140 --> 03:46.120
I asked you to contact

03:46.120 --> 03:47.010
Shengshi Huayu.

03:47.010 --> 03:47.930
Did you get in touch with them?

03:47.930 --> 03:48.560
Yes.

03:48.770 --> 03:50.010
I contacted Lena,

03:50.010 --> 03:52.079
their person in charge in Pingchuan.

03:52.450 --> 03:53.840
She's open to a meeting,

03:54.490 --> 03:55.360
but she wants

03:55.360 --> 03:56.890
Mr. Lu to meet her in person.

03:58.040 --> 04:00.210
[Shengshi Huayu
IP Development Capabilities]

03:58.140 --> 03:58.990
In person?

03:59.050 --> 04:00.510
Yes, that's what she said.

04:00.800 --> 04:01.240
Wait.

04:01.240 --> 04:02.640
She wants to meet me?

04:02.640 --> 04:03.050
Yes.

04:03.050 --> 04:04.180
Just go as she wants.

04:09.890 --> 04:11.290
Then who's going with me?

04:11.300 --> 04:13.060
[Shengshi Huayu
IP Development Capabilities]

04:11.930 --> 04:12.610
Me!

04:12.610 --> 04:14.960
-I'll go!
-Easy. You scared me.

04:14.960 --> 04:16.560
Why are you so eager this time?

04:16.560 --> 04:17.000
Well,

04:17.050 --> 04:17.800
I heard

04:17.800 --> 04:19.120
that Lena is a beauty.

04:19.120 --> 04:19.610
I...

04:20.120 --> 04:21.649
S-So,

04:21.649 --> 04:22.530
this beauty wants to meet

04:22.530 --> 04:23.320
with Xixiao?

04:23.320 --> 04:25.300
Sounds like she's up to something.

04:25.930 --> 04:27.000
Definitely.

04:26.410 --> 04:29.880
[Shengshi Huayu
IP Development Capabilities]

04:27.050 --> 04:28.240
Then I can't steal Xixiao's

04:28.240 --> 04:29.680
-thunder.
-Alright.

04:30.000 --> 04:30.560
You?

04:31.180 --> 04:32.440
Deputy Director Zhou,

04:34.130 --> 04:35.130
what do you think?

04:36.000 --> 04:38.330
I'll follow the company's arrangements.

04:42.409 --> 04:43.290
Bad move.

04:43.290 --> 04:44.090
Alright then.

04:44.650 --> 04:45.800
The company's

04:46.240 --> 04:47.370
sending you with me.

04:48.490 --> 04:49.090
Okay.

04:51.840 --> 04:53.770
Xin, let's do a...

04:54.650 --> 04:55.650
preliminary run-through

04:55.650 --> 04:57.030
with Wanxiang Queyu

04:57.120 --> 04:58.440
-Okay.
-as well.

04:58.440 --> 04:59.850
Right. Besides...

05:08.410 --> 05:10.050
When's Ms. Lin coming?

05:10.360 --> 05:12.160
We've been waiting over an hour.

05:12.490 --> 05:14.220
Didn't expect her to be so late.

05:18.560 --> 05:19.930
Let's go sit over there.

05:39.680 --> 05:41.450
Can I get you some tea?

05:41.490 --> 05:42.090
No thanks.

05:42.610 --> 05:44.090
When is Ms. Lin coming?

05:44.490 --> 05:45.240
Sorry,

05:45.240 --> 05:46.730
Ms. Lin went out temporarily.

05:46.730 --> 05:47.650
I'm not sure

05:47.650 --> 05:48.850
when she'll be back.

05:50.320 --> 05:52.140
But we had an appointment.

05:52.640 --> 05:53.490
I know.

05:53.490 --> 05:54.610
I'm really sorry.

05:54.610 --> 05:55.290
Ms. Lin

05:55.290 --> 05:57.000
changed her plans last minute,

05:57.000 --> 05:59.260
probably didn't have time to notify you.

06:00.930 --> 06:02.850
Can you give us a definite answer?

06:02.850 --> 06:03.880
So we know whether

06:03.880 --> 06:05.730
to keep waiting

06:05.730 --> 06:06.440
or

06:06.440 --> 06:07.850
reschedule.

06:09.680 --> 06:10.120
Let me

06:10.120 --> 06:11.410
call and ask.

06:19.220 --> 06:20.080
Hello, Ms. Lin?

06:21.370 --> 06:22.700
Tell them to come up now.

06:23.610 --> 06:24.240
Okay.

06:27.230 --> 06:28.240
Ms. Lin said

06:28.240 --> 06:29.240
she's back now.

06:29.240 --> 06:30.290
She's upstairs.

06:30.320 --> 06:31.410
If you don't mind,

06:31.410 --> 06:32.440
you can find her over there.

06:32.440 --> 06:32.760
Okay.

06:32.760 --> 06:33.320
I'll take you there.

06:33.320 --> 06:33.800
-Okay.
-Let's go.

06:33.800 --> 06:34.290
Okay.

06:49.440 --> 06:50.440
Watch the steps.

06:57.800 --> 06:58.800
This way, please.

07:09.320 --> 07:09.880
Ms. Lin.

07:10.930 --> 07:11.410
Please.

07:13.440 --> 07:14.610
Hello, Ms. Lin.

07:15.880 --> 07:17.470
I'm in charge of Lan Yue Phase II,

07:17.470 --> 07:18.230
Lu Xixiao.

07:19.490 --> 07:20.120
Hello.

07:20.410 --> 07:21.200
I'm Zhou Wan.

07:22.320 --> 07:23.050
Waiter.

07:23.120 --> 07:24.450
One more glass, please.

07:24.490 --> 07:25.120
Well,

07:25.730 --> 07:27.190
I won't drink during work.

07:28.200 --> 07:29.010
Have a seat.

07:29.040 --> 07:29.770
Thank you.

07:48.760 --> 07:49.530
Lu Xixiao,

07:49.530 --> 07:50.860
don't you recognize me?

07:53.930 --> 07:54.560
Ms. Lin.

07:56.000 --> 07:58.490
Or would you prefer Lena?

08:02.320 --> 08:04.120
We dated a few times,

08:04.160 --> 08:05.960
and you don't even recognize me?

08:07.660 --> 08:08.680
I'm Lin Na.

08:10.970 --> 08:11.570
Forget it.

08:11.980 --> 08:14.040
You probably don't remember anyway.

08:17.120 --> 08:17.760
No.

08:18.360 --> 08:18.930
I do.

08:20.090 --> 08:21.120
I just didn't recognize you.

08:21.120 --> 08:23.120
Now that you mention it, I remember.

08:24.850 --> 08:25.760
What happened back then—

08:25.760 --> 08:27.120
that was on me.

08:27.730 --> 08:28.870
I was still young.

08:29.630 --> 08:31.410
Hope... Hope it doesn't

08:31.410 --> 08:33.750
affect our conversation today.

08:37.049 --> 08:38.320
Back when we dated,

08:38.320 --> 08:39.530
you were always late.

08:40.960 --> 08:42.409
I waited for you so many times,

08:42.409 --> 08:43.890
and in the end, all I got was

08:44.010 --> 08:44.840
"I'm not coming."

08:44.840 --> 08:46.370
Now I've made you wait a bit.

08:46.970 --> 08:48.070
We're even.

08:51.930 --> 08:53.250
But you're wronged.

08:57.450 --> 08:58.680
I'm here to work.

09:03.250 --> 09:04.370
But don't worry.

09:04.890 --> 09:06.350
It won't affect your work.

09:08.720 --> 09:09.320
Thank you.

09:12.840 --> 09:13.770
I've sent your invitation

09:13.770 --> 09:14.970
to the headquarters.

09:15.330 --> 09:17.310
But the president refused.

09:17.800 --> 09:19.170
It's really not my fault.

09:19.170 --> 09:20.100
Nothing I can do.

09:21.800 --> 09:22.770
Any chance I could ask

09:22.770 --> 09:24.500
why the president rejected it?

09:26.560 --> 09:27.720
I can't really say.

09:32.960 --> 09:35.130
Is it for the same reason Shengshi Huayu

09:35.130 --> 09:36.680
shut down all its theme parks

09:36.680 --> 09:37.600
back then?

09:38.720 --> 09:39.650
How did you know?

09:40.410 --> 09:41.560
I was just guessing.

09:42.800 --> 09:44.200
Can you give me some time?

09:45.840 --> 09:46.770
What do you want?

09:47.290 --> 09:48.320
I want to give your president

09:48.320 --> 09:49.250
a small gift.

09:50.960 --> 09:51.720
A gift?

10:09.530 --> 10:10.200
Do you know

10:10.200 --> 10:11.320
what he's up to?

10:15.890 --> 10:16.800
Not really.

10:17.290 --> 10:18.480
But if he's doing it,

10:18.480 --> 10:19.880
he must have his reasons.

10:25.480 --> 10:27.480
You're his girlfriend, aren't you?

10:29.010 --> 10:29.800
Bingo.

10:32.170 --> 10:32.930
Don't worry

10:33.200 --> 10:34.320
about me.

10:35.250 --> 10:36.170
I met Lu Xixiao

10:36.170 --> 10:37.290
the summer after the college

10:37.290 --> 10:38.150
entrance exam.

10:38.840 --> 10:39.800
We've only seen

10:39.800 --> 10:41.060
each other a few times.

10:42.290 --> 10:44.350
He was always pretty distant with me.

10:45.000 --> 10:46.120
I thought

10:46.410 --> 10:47.480
he was just one of

10:47.770 --> 10:50.230
those clueless, emotionally stunted guys.

10:51.320 --> 10:52.720
Until I saw you two today.

10:57.840 --> 10:59.050
Actually,

11:00.930 --> 11:02.350
he's the dull type.

11:04.180 --> 11:05.640
With a resting grump face.

11:06.770 --> 11:07.840
And he sweats a lot.

11:09.480 --> 11:10.290
Don't you think

11:10.290 --> 11:11.350
he's a bit too tall?

11:12.280 --> 11:13.230
Right?

11:14.370 --> 11:16.770
Standing next to him
makes me look so short.

11:24.680 --> 11:25.290
So he's into

11:25.290 --> 11:26.150
girls like you.

11:37.290 --> 11:38.120
This is good.

11:38.650 --> 11:39.200
Right?

11:39.890 --> 11:40.560
Thank you.

11:44.560 --> 11:46.090
How much longer, Lu Xixiao?

11:47.040 --> 11:47.990
How much longer?

11:48.330 --> 11:49.660
Almost there. Soon.

12:05.130 --> 12:07.130
No wonder you're the great artist L.

12:07.770 --> 12:08.530
I think our president

12:08.530 --> 12:09.390
will love this.

12:10.440 --> 12:11.130
This is my first piece

12:11.130 --> 12:12.590
that's not about winter.

12:13.530 --> 12:14.930
Please tell him—

12:14.960 --> 12:17.050
it was his story
that gave me the inspiration.

12:17.050 --> 12:17.560
Okay.

12:18.080 --> 12:18.720
Anything else you

12:18.720 --> 12:19.920
want me to pass along?

12:23.080 --> 12:24.050
I hope

12:24.320 --> 12:25.940
you'll seriously consider

12:26.080 --> 12:27.130
our proposal.

12:27.490 --> 12:29.150
Lan Yue provides the funding,

12:29.440 --> 12:30.480
and Shengshi Huayu

12:30.480 --> 12:31.960
runs the core operations.

12:32.290 --> 12:33.680
We can build the newest

12:33.680 --> 12:34.840
resort IP together.

12:36.410 --> 12:37.260
Lu Xixiao,

12:37.890 --> 12:39.950
I didn't expect you to be so talented.

12:40.600 --> 12:41.770
All my

12:43.650 --> 12:44.840
inspiration

12:44.840 --> 12:46.700
comes from this woman right here—

12:46.930 --> 12:47.930
Zhou Wan.

12:49.480 --> 12:51.440
That's so sweet of you.

12:53.720 --> 12:54.370
Don't worry.

12:54.370 --> 12:55.250
I'll send this

12:55.250 --> 12:57.050
to our president as soon as I can.

12:57.320 --> 12:58.890
I won't see you two out.

12:58.890 --> 12:59.530
Take care.

12:59.530 --> 13:00.600
Okay, thank you.

13:02.370 --> 13:03.370
See you next time.

13:03.370 --> 13:04.630
Let's drink next time.

13:10.530 --> 13:11.060
Your bag.

13:13.290 --> 13:14.250
See you around.

13:19.650 --> 13:20.840
Taking your current girlfriend
to meet your ex?

13:20.840 --> 13:22.050
Good for you.

13:22.050 --> 13:22.650
No.

13:22.650 --> 13:23.840
I didn't get a chance

13:23.840 --> 13:24.960
to tell you

13:24.960 --> 13:25.800
what happened between us.

13:25.800 --> 13:26.720
I was having nightmares
every night back then,

13:26.720 --> 13:28.050
and you were out there dating?

13:28.050 --> 13:28.600
No,

13:28.630 --> 13:29.250
let me explain.

13:29.250 --> 13:30.440
Zhou Wan,

13:30.440 --> 13:31.250
Listen.

13:33.250 --> 13:33.890
Remember when

13:33.890 --> 13:34.650
we broke up,

13:34.650 --> 13:36.250
and you wanted to pay me back?

13:37.440 --> 13:38.560
I was at a bar,

13:38.560 --> 13:39.250
drinking.

13:39.840 --> 13:40.800
While I was drinking,

13:40.800 --> 13:41.800
your transfer notification

13:41.800 --> 13:42.600
came through.

13:42.890 --> 13:44.550
And right at that same moment,

13:44.840 --> 13:46.550
someone asked me out.

13:47.010 --> 13:48.250
I was impulsive, so I said yes

13:48.250 --> 13:48.930
back then.

13:49.440 --> 13:50.090
I mean,

13:50.200 --> 13:51.680
we barely saw each other.

13:51.680 --> 13:53.050
We lost touch pretty quickly.

13:53.050 --> 13:53.530
Nothing

13:53.530 --> 13:54.560
happened between us.

13:54.560 --> 13:55.960
-Really.
-You better be.

13:57.560 --> 13:58.560
So what was that painting

13:58.560 --> 14:00.360
you sent to the president about?

14:01.530 --> 14:03.050
I looked into his story.

14:04.130 --> 14:05.080
It's said

14:05.440 --> 14:05.840
that he had

14:05.840 --> 14:07.320
a girlfriend of eight years.

14:07.320 --> 14:08.650
They were really close,

14:08.770 --> 14:09.970
about to get married.

14:10.890 --> 14:11.840
But right before the engagement,

14:11.840 --> 14:13.180
they had

14:12.250 --> 14:17.240
[Cafe
Please go upstairs]

14:13.650 --> 14:15.250
a diving accident together.

14:15.600 --> 14:16.660
She didn't make it.

14:17.720 --> 14:19.050
So I thought,

14:19.370 --> 14:20.600
what else besides life and death

14:20.600 --> 14:22.060
is truly insurmountable?

14:22.560 --> 14:23.320
At least you and I

14:23.320 --> 14:24.480
get to choose to be together now.

14:24.480 --> 14:25.170
Right?

14:28.010 --> 14:29.250
Don't you think

14:29.250 --> 14:30.440
that's romantic?

14:30.440 --> 14:31.890
What's romance got to do with you?

14:31.890 --> 14:32.480
I am a very

14:32.480 --> 14:33.560
romantic person.

14:33.800 --> 14:35.060
Where's your romance?

14:36.770 --> 14:37.530
Right...

14:38.180 --> 14:43.000
[Ice cream]

14:38.690 --> 14:39.470
here.

14:40.290 --> 14:42.200
Since when do you know magic tricks?

14:42.200 --> 14:43.130
Do you remember?

14:43.720 --> 14:45.180
Anyone would remember it.

14:46.480 --> 14:48.210
I should have told you earlier.

14:48.530 --> 14:49.200
Zhou Wan,

14:51.320 --> 14:52.480
do you wanna date me?

15:03.520 --> 15:07.430
[Ice cream]

15:04.340 --> 15:06.100
Do you?

15:11.800 --> 15:13.230
Aren't we dating now?

15:17.180 --> 15:18.670
♪ Countless, unforgettable ♪

15:19.290 --> 15:20.810
♪ No time left, so I ♪

15:21.410 --> 15:23.470
♪ Can only fall toward you ♪

15:24.640 --> 15:30.440
[Ice cream]

15:25.470 --> 15:28.050
♪ Too dazzling, too lonely, it's alright ♪

15:28.260 --> 15:31.670
♪ I believe in this encounter ♪

15:33.660 --> 15:36.000
♪ Landing in the ruins of the galaxy ♪

15:36.100 --> 15:39.820
♪ Exchanging our comets ♪

15:41.660 --> 15:42.990
♪ Suddenly I am certain ♪

15:43.040 --> 15:45.750
♪ This mud all over me ♪

15:44.130 --> 15:44.720
Where did you

15:44.720 --> 15:46.100
even get that balloon?

15:46.650 --> 15:47.480
I won't tell you.

15:46.710 --> 15:49.160
♪ Is the proof of love ♪

16:00.670 --> 16:03.680
[Strategic Director]

16:06.540 --> 16:12.410
[Project Director]

16:10.770 --> 16:12.430
I know what you're going to do.

16:12.770 --> 16:13.680
I can help.

16:14.130 --> 16:15.480
We got word back from Shengshi Huayu!

16:15.480 --> 16:16.130
Come on!

16:21.810 --> 16:25.890
[Project Director]

16:24.200 --> 16:24.890
Hello?

16:25.410 --> 16:26.560
The president said your work

16:26.560 --> 16:27.200
really moved him.

16:27.200 --> 16:28.080
He loved it

16:28.250 --> 16:29.650
and asked me to thank you.

16:30.870 --> 16:31.500
Also,

16:32.010 --> 16:33.250
he's seriously considered

16:33.250 --> 16:34.850
your partnership proposal.

16:35.130 --> 16:36.010
He said—

16:39.370 --> 16:40.770
What did he say? Hurry up.

16:44.080 --> 16:46.080
He said he's willing to give it a try.

16:47.050 --> 16:48.560
But on one condition that all IP

16:48.560 --> 16:50.270
and core visual design

16:50.720 --> 16:51.840
must be led

16:51.690 --> 16:53.080
[Project Director]

16:51.840 --> 16:53.130
by L yourself.

16:53.610 --> 16:54.630
[Project Director]

16:57.480 --> 16:58.370
Wan!

17:05.930 --> 17:07.369
Then let's wish a successful partnership

17:07.369 --> 17:09.369
between Lan Yue and Shengshi Huayu.

17:16.240 --> 17:17.680
Director Zhou and Director Lu

17:17.680 --> 17:18.650
bringing in

17:18.650 --> 17:20.849
such an important partner for Lan Yue!

17:23.760 --> 17:25.089
We have to

17:25.089 --> 17:26.560
celebrate for this, Wan!

17:26.680 --> 17:27.369
Yeah.

17:28.280 --> 17:30.280
I'm treating everyone to the most

17:30.280 --> 17:32.520
expensive tea cafe downstairs!

17:32.520 --> 17:34.240
Tea cafe!

17:37.040 --> 17:38.440
But Director Lu will pay.

17:39.130 --> 17:39.890
Thank you, Xixiao.

17:39.890 --> 17:40.650
Okay. No problem.

17:40.650 --> 17:41.370
I'll pay.

17:41.370 --> 17:42.930
Director Lu and Wan

17:42.930 --> 17:45.000
actually look pretty good together.

17:45.000 --> 17:46.200
What do you mean by that?

17:46.200 --> 17:48.330
They've got a firm comradeship.

17:48.330 --> 17:49.090
Why does everything have

17:49.090 --> 17:51.000
to be about romance to you?

17:51.000 --> 17:52.480
You're the one who doesn't get it.

17:52.480 --> 17:53.330
Only those who feel in sync

17:53.330 --> 17:54.280
can fight together

17:54.280 --> 17:55.200
and share the same mind.

17:55.200 --> 17:56.040
What's the difference

17:56.040 --> 17:57.850
between that and a relationship?

17:57.850 --> 17:58.410
Alright.

17:59.280 --> 18:00.280
-Let's go eat.
-Stop it.

18:00.280 --> 18:01.170
Are we eating or not?

18:01.170 --> 18:02.240
-Yes.
-Let's go.

18:02.240 --> 18:03.200
Tidy up and go eat.

18:03.200 --> 18:04.000
Let's go.

18:07.240 --> 18:08.200
Dismiss.

18:08.200 --> 18:09.760
Aren't they a match?

18:09.890 --> 18:10.810
Wan.

18:20.570 --> 18:22.930
Dad, Grandma,

18:23.760 --> 18:25.170
we're here to see you.

18:25.980 --> 18:29.120
[In Memory of My Son, Zhou Jun]

18:29.120 --> 18:33.290
[In Memory of Huang Xuefen]

18:34.890 --> 18:36.130
Today I brought someone

18:36.130 --> 18:38.000
really, really important.

18:39.850 --> 18:41.240
Grandma's already met him,

18:41.240 --> 18:42.680
but Dad hasn't.

18:46.810 --> 18:48.710
Uncle, Grandma,

18:49.930 --> 18:51.000
I'm Lu Xixiao,

18:52.000 --> 18:53.280
Zhou Wan's boyfriend.

18:55.000 --> 18:56.280
I came with her

18:56.850 --> 18:58.090
to see you today.

19:00.480 --> 19:01.520
Don't worry.

19:02.370 --> 19:03.900
When you're not by her side,

19:04.810 --> 19:06.040
I will stay with her

19:06.680 --> 19:08.080
and take good care of her.

19:08.810 --> 19:09.650
I won't let her

19:09.650 --> 19:10.910
suffer any injustice.

19:26.330 --> 19:27.920
When I was young,

19:29.440 --> 19:30.720
I liked to

19:31.440 --> 19:33.100
leaning on my dad's shoulder.

19:35.640 --> 19:36.860
I always thought

19:39.720 --> 19:41.680
the safest place in the world

19:44.650 --> 19:45.960
was my dad's shoulder.

19:51.930 --> 19:52.710
Later...

19:54.930 --> 19:56.370
Everyone, please don't leave.

19:56.370 --> 19:58.040
Just give me a few more days, okay?

19:58.040 --> 19:59.480
I'll figure something out, I promise.

19:59.480 --> 20:00.680
I know things are hard for you,

20:00.680 --> 20:01.570
but I'll get this sorted

20:01.570 --> 20:02.910
in a few days.

20:03.170 --> 20:03.840
-This…
-Director!

20:03.840 --> 20:05.370
Let's go get the money back!

20:06.650 --> 20:08.280
-Give us the money!
-We can talk.

20:08.280 --> 20:09.410
Don't barge in there!

20:09.410 --> 20:10.170
Don't rush!

20:10.170 --> 20:10.770
Director!

20:11.000 --> 20:11.760
When are you

20:11.760 --> 20:12.890
paying us our wages?

20:13.850 --> 20:14.330
Well,

20:14.420 --> 20:15.810
I've already paid

20:15.810 --> 20:16.650
part of it.

20:16.650 --> 20:17.610
Right?

20:17.640 --> 20:19.480
I'll figure out the rest.

20:19.480 --> 20:21.210
Just give me a little more time.

20:22.570 --> 20:23.640
Give you time?

20:23.960 --> 20:25.210
No, you can't...

20:25.440 --> 20:27.110
Who's giving us time?

20:27.410 --> 20:28.570
My whole family's

20:28.570 --> 20:30.170
depending on this to eat.

20:30.480 --> 20:31.330
Don't leave!

20:31.480 --> 20:32.340
Come back here!

20:32.850 --> 20:33.450
Come back!

20:34.960 --> 20:35.920
Listen!

20:36.000 --> 20:37.330
-You have money now!
-Dad!

20:37.330 --> 20:38.280
Your kid has food!

20:38.280 --> 20:38.890
But our kids

20:38.890 --> 20:39.890
-don't!
-Dad!

20:39.890 --> 20:41.130
Look at you now!

20:41.240 --> 20:42.240
If you end up dead,

20:42.240 --> 20:44.500
who are we supposed to get the money from?

21:43.870 --> 21:49.820
[In Loving Memory]

21:44.680 --> 21:45.280
Zhou Wan.

21:47.130 --> 21:49.260
I'm not the one who killed your father.

21:51.240 --> 21:52.680
You think you're smart,

21:53.480 --> 21:54.860
but you're hating

21:55.610 --> 21:56.860
the wrong person.

21:55.760 --> 21:58.710
[In Loving Memory]

21:58.810 --> 22:02.970
[In Memory of My Son, Zhou Jun]

22:12.170 --> 22:14.110
Lu Zhongyue is a cold, calculating,

22:14.110 --> 22:15.380
selfish man

22:15.480 --> 22:17.540
who's hurt too many innocent people.

22:19.090 --> 22:20.360
Some things

22:20.480 --> 22:21.800
come with a price.

22:22.090 --> 22:24.090
The timing just hasn't arrived yet.

22:42.960 --> 22:44.410
Because of Lu Zhongyue,

22:44.680 --> 22:46.610
my family was destroyed back then.

22:47.330 --> 22:48.390
And even so,

22:48.520 --> 22:50.520
my father was misunderstood by all.

22:50.960 --> 22:52.650
But he was such a good man.

22:54.240 --> 22:55.000
I can't let him

22:55.000 --> 22:56.460
keep bearing that stigma.

22:56.650 --> 22:58.260
I want to uncover the truth

22:58.890 --> 23:01.120
and clear his name.

23:01.170 --> 23:02.000
I believe justice

23:02.000 --> 23:03.040
will come.

23:07.720 --> 23:08.370
Zhou Wan,

23:09.000 --> 23:10.280
do what you need to do.

23:14.200 --> 23:16.530
But I don't want
to get you involved again,

23:16.800 --> 23:18.660
or make things difficult for you.

23:18.760 --> 23:21.480
After all, Lu Zhongyue is your father.

23:23.680 --> 23:25.020
I'll always be with you.

23:25.930 --> 23:27.260
No matter what happens,

23:27.610 --> 23:28.940
we'll face it together.

23:44.170 --> 23:45.240
I went through all that

23:45.240 --> 23:46.890
trying to get into Lan Yue Phase II

23:46.890 --> 23:47.410
just to

23:47.410 --> 23:48.570
find some leads.

23:49.650 --> 23:50.680
But I still haven't

23:50.680 --> 23:52.610
found any evidence from back then.

23:53.570 --> 23:54.810
But I did find this.

23:57.350 --> 23:58.610
[Yinshan Furniture Factory
Acquisition Agreement]

23:57.960 --> 23:58.930
It's a furniture factory acquired

23:58.930 --> 24:00.170
during the Phase II resort project.

23:59.150 --> 24:01.260
[Yinshan Furniture Factory
Acquisition Agreement]

24:01.080 --> 24:02.480
The board hadn't decided

24:02.480 --> 24:03.410
on internal bidding yet,

24:03.410 --> 24:04.200
so the project

24:04.200 --> 24:06.400
was still under Lu Zhongyue's control.

24:06.440 --> 24:07.370
Yinshan Furniture Factory

24:07.370 --> 24:08.370
was a stable,

24:08.380 --> 24:10.000
[Final Acquisition Price:]

24:08.440 --> 24:10.000
long-established factory.

24:10.000 --> 24:11.190
[RMB 250,000]

24:10.170 --> 24:11.570
If they wanted to make more money,

24:11.280 --> 24:12.920
[Yinshan Furniture Factory Profile]

24:11.680 --> 24:13.610
they would have expanded long ago.

24:13.680 --> 24:14.850
They stayed in Jinsha Bay

24:14.850 --> 24:16.580
to keep quality under control.

24:19.000 --> 24:20.600
And this happened right when

24:21.200 --> 24:23.600
Lan Yue was acquiring
the land for Phase II.

24:24.610 --> 24:25.440
Furniture of this scale

24:25.440 --> 24:26.770
with such big problems?

24:28.570 --> 24:29.930
So you suspect Lu Zhongyue

24:29.930 --> 24:31.530
pulled the same trick again.

24:35.040 --> 24:36.370
That's a good lead.

24:37.570 --> 24:38.240
But we still need

24:38.240 --> 24:39.000
evidence.

24:40.090 --> 24:41.900
So I want to go to Jinsha Bay.

24:43.410 --> 24:44.470
I'm going with you.

24:46.130 --> 24:47.330
I don't think you should come.

24:47.330 --> 24:48.280
Remember what

24:48.480 --> 24:50.170
I told your dad and grandma?

24:50.720 --> 24:51.370
I said

24:51.370 --> 24:52.520
I wouldn't let you

24:52.520 --> 24:53.680
face this alone.

24:53.890 --> 24:54.680
I'm going to take care of you

24:54.680 --> 24:55.610
and protect you.

25:07.680 --> 25:08.480
Okay.

25:09.520 --> 25:10.580
Let's go together.

25:20.440 --> 25:21.840
I think this is the place.

25:25.520 --> 25:26.930
Sorry to bother you.

25:27.720 --> 25:30.240
Is there an adult home?

25:32.000 --> 25:32.650
Grandma.

25:36.480 --> 25:37.480
Who are you?

25:38.760 --> 25:39.680
Hello, Grandma.

25:39.680 --> 25:40.520
Excuse me.

25:40.520 --> 25:41.050
Grandma.

25:41.480 --> 25:42.720
You... You are?

25:43.440 --> 25:44.090
Who are you?

25:44.090 --> 25:45.570
We don't accept interviews.

25:45.570 --> 25:46.700
We're not the media.

25:47.240 --> 25:47.930
Not the media.

25:47.930 --> 25:48.760
We called your house

25:48.760 --> 25:49.330
before,

25:49.330 --> 25:50.000
but no one answered,

25:50.000 --> 25:50.760
so we thought

25:50.760 --> 25:52.090
we'd come talk in person.

25:52.090 --> 25:53.570
There's nothing to talk about.

25:53.570 --> 25:55.720
We'll pay back the debt.

25:55.850 --> 25:56.570
You can leave.

25:56.570 --> 25:57.930
-We're not here for money.
-Leave.

25:57.930 --> 25:58.650
Leave..

25:59.000 --> 25:59.720
-Fine.
-Leave.

25:59.720 --> 26:01.000
-Leave!
-We'll leave.

26:01.000 --> 26:01.520
We're leaving.

26:01.520 --> 26:02.520
What if I could prove

26:02.520 --> 26:03.720
that Director Wang's factory

26:03.720 --> 26:04.810
was set up?

26:12.650 --> 26:13.570
To be honest,

26:14.720 --> 26:16.090
I've been through

26:16.760 --> 26:18.290
what you're going through.

26:20.570 --> 26:21.850
So I understand.

26:23.200 --> 26:24.800
And I genuinely want to help.

26:25.890 --> 26:27.000
If Director Wang

26:27.000 --> 26:28.600
is willing to accept our help

26:29.280 --> 26:30.680
and tell us what happened

26:30.680 --> 26:31.890
to the furniture factory,

26:31.890 --> 26:32.680
we'll do

26:32.680 --> 26:33.760
everything we can

26:33.760 --> 26:34.890
to get you justice.

26:43.680 --> 26:44.370
Little girl,

26:44.370 --> 26:46.300
could I borrow some paper and a pen?

26:47.280 --> 26:47.930
Thank you.

26:57.090 --> 26:57.760
Grandma,

26:58.120 --> 26:59.550
this is my number.

27:00.130 --> 27:01.040
From now on, no matter what

27:01.040 --> 27:02.040
problems come up—

27:02.890 --> 27:04.200
not just the factory,

27:04.200 --> 27:05.930
but also the girl's situation,

27:06.040 --> 27:06.970
anything at all,

27:07.130 --> 27:08.760
feel free to call me.

27:12.290 --> 27:14.380
I'll call my son and ask.

27:15.500 --> 27:18.000
I can't promise he'll agree.

27:19.200 --> 27:19.930
That's fine.

27:20.570 --> 27:22.100
We'll wait for your answer.

27:22.610 --> 27:23.280
We just got here,

27:23.280 --> 27:24.960
brought you some food and drinks,

27:24.960 --> 27:26.240
and some snacks for her.

27:26.240 --> 27:26.760
No need.

27:27.000 --> 27:28.040
-Please take it.
-I can't.

27:28.040 --> 27:28.960
Don't worry about it.

27:28.960 --> 27:30.130
We'll just leave it inside for you.

27:30.130 --> 27:31.090
I'll put it in the house.

27:31.090 --> 27:31.720
Here.

27:41.130 --> 27:41.950
We'll

27:42.200 --> 27:43.410
come visit you often.

27:44.720 --> 27:45.450
Little girl,

27:46.410 --> 27:47.890
you must study hard.

27:48.440 --> 27:49.480
Read good books.

27:49.680 --> 27:50.520
Study well.

27:53.090 --> 27:54.750
The score isn't what matters.

27:55.290 --> 27:57.420
It's the ability to learn that counts.

27:58.040 --> 27:58.930
Thank you, Miss.

27:58.930 --> 27:59.790
Thank you, Sir.

27:59.890 --> 28:00.520
Alright.

28:04.200 --> 28:05.600
You'll need to sign here.

28:07.520 --> 28:08.890
Sign right here.

28:09.280 --> 28:10.440
So I just have to wait for the buyer

28:10.440 --> 28:11.480
to come back from abroad

28:11.480 --> 28:13.410
before the contract is finalized?

28:13.570 --> 28:14.890
That's right, Mrs. Jiang.

28:14.890 --> 28:16.280
They'll pay the deposit

28:16.280 --> 28:17.090
to you first.

28:17.760 --> 28:18.930
Once they're back,

28:19.040 --> 28:20.200
they'll settle the balance

28:20.200 --> 28:21.600
and handle the transfer.

28:21.850 --> 28:23.100
But this house...

28:24.280 --> 28:25.240
Here's the thing.

28:25.240 --> 28:26.090
The buyer wants

28:26.090 --> 28:27.370
to get things ready

28:27.480 --> 28:29.520
so they can move straight in
when they return.

28:29.520 --> 28:30.640
I'm afraid you have

28:30.850 --> 28:32.830
to vacate the house now.

28:32.890 --> 28:34.290
It's fine. I understand.

28:34.480 --> 28:35.680
Thank you, Mrs. Jiang.

28:35.680 --> 28:37.070
The keys, please.

28:41.960 --> 28:42.680
I need to take this call.

28:42.680 --> 28:43.540
Suit yourself.

28:44.800 --> 28:45.590
Mr. Wang?

28:46.240 --> 28:46.980
Check out the house in the afternoon?

28:46.980 --> 28:47.730
No problem.

28:57.040 --> 28:57.810
Jiang Fan,

28:58.720 --> 29:00.320
the house is already sold.

29:00.720 --> 29:02.780
I'll transfer the money to you later.

29:03.140 --> 29:05.270
Remember to give the keys to the agent.

29:11.040 --> 29:12.390
Okay, got it.

29:39.480 --> 29:40.240
Dad!

29:43.930 --> 29:45.040
I miss you so much.

29:51.170 --> 29:51.810
Guess

29:51.960 --> 29:52.680
what delicious food

29:52.680 --> 29:53.650
I brought you.

29:54.610 --> 29:55.480
Chicken wings.

29:58.520 --> 29:59.760
Dad, look!

29:59.760 --> 30:00.960
Those were all

30:00.960 --> 30:01.720
from Wan.

30:01.720 --> 30:02.760
And Xixiao even offered

30:02.760 --> 30:04.160
to sponsor my schooling.

30:06.040 --> 30:06.930
Sit down first.

30:11.580 --> 30:12.470
Lili,

30:12.960 --> 30:14.650
what did I tell you before?

30:15.280 --> 30:16.940
Don't trust people so easily.

30:18.280 --> 30:19.520
I ended up

30:19.610 --> 30:20.610
to where I am today

30:21.000 --> 30:21.850
because I was

30:21.850 --> 30:22.930
too trusting.

30:24.000 --> 30:24.700
Dad,

30:24.760 --> 30:26.200
Wan and Xixiao

30:26.200 --> 30:27.240
are not like that.

30:28.850 --> 30:30.410
How long have you known them?

30:30.410 --> 30:31.320
How do you know

30:31.370 --> 30:33.170
they're not that kind of person?

30:34.170 --> 30:35.330
That girl's family

30:35.480 --> 30:36.680
went through

30:37.000 --> 30:38.280
the same thing.

30:38.720 --> 30:39.850
Remember that

30:39.850 --> 30:41.440
building materials factory

30:41.440 --> 30:43.640
before Lan Yue Resort Phase I was built?

30:45.170 --> 30:46.090
I think

30:46.330 --> 30:47.850
they're both good people.

30:47.850 --> 30:49.810
They're genuinely here to help us.

30:52.960 --> 30:53.850
I know.

30:55.480 --> 30:56.440
I've already agreed

30:56.440 --> 30:57.680
to meet with them.

30:59.040 --> 30:59.650
Mom,

31:00.000 --> 31:01.200
don't worry about it.

31:33.050 --> 31:34.040
Watch this.

31:53.130 --> 31:54.930
Where did you learn to make that?

31:55.000 --> 31:56.040
Soft-boiled egg.

31:58.570 --> 31:59.280
Thank you.

32:12.000 --> 32:13.170
I used to love

32:13.170 --> 32:14.430
soft-boiled eggs too.

32:15.000 --> 32:17.570
Especially with tomato and egg noodles.

32:19.110 --> 32:21.770
But later my mom thought
it was too much trouble,

32:22.570 --> 32:24.300
so I barely had them after that.

32:28.280 --> 32:29.280
It's good to be grown up.

32:29.280 --> 32:30.680
I can eat whatever I want.

32:32.370 --> 32:33.760
Lately I keep thinking back to

32:33.760 --> 32:34.330
when we first met

32:34.330 --> 32:35.370
as kids.

32:38.200 --> 32:39.280
I never understood

32:39.280 --> 32:40.680
why you always avoided me

32:42.090 --> 32:43.490
and dodged my questions,

32:44.090 --> 32:46.690
and why you were
so afraid of troubling anyone.

32:47.960 --> 32:49.170
But now I get it.

32:51.650 --> 32:52.610
You went through so much

32:52.610 --> 32:53.810
when you were little,

32:54.890 --> 32:56.040
losing people and things

32:56.040 --> 32:57.090
all the time,

32:58.200 --> 32:59.710
that you forced yourself

33:00.170 --> 33:01.170
to face the world

33:01.170 --> 33:02.200
with a cool,

33:02.200 --> 33:03.200
rational way.

33:06.810 --> 33:07.680
Every time I think about that,

33:07.680 --> 33:08.570
I wish...

33:10.570 --> 33:11.890
I could have met that little

33:11.890 --> 33:13.130
Zhou Wan earlier.

33:14.850 --> 33:16.000
I'd tell her—

33:17.480 --> 33:18.410
Don't be scared.

33:18.930 --> 33:19.760
Don't rush.

33:21.090 --> 33:22.170
I'll be here

33:22.720 --> 33:23.810
to grow up with you.

33:30.040 --> 33:30.960
So

33:32.040 --> 33:33.370
you have to understand,

33:35.200 --> 33:37.060
a soft-boiled egg isn't a bother.

33:38.720 --> 33:39.850
And neither are you.

33:41.040 --> 33:43.040
In fact, I like it when you bother me.

33:50.480 --> 33:52.520
Why are you so good to me?

33:56.810 --> 33:59.930
I wasn't good enough to you before.

34:01.850 --> 34:03.890
From now on, I'll try even harder,

34:05.810 --> 34:07.570
better than you are to me.

34:10.440 --> 34:11.159
You said it.

34:13.480 --> 34:14.639
Then...

34:15.929 --> 34:16.730
that promise

34:16.730 --> 34:17.929
starts tonight?

34:20.290 --> 34:20.960
Okay.

34:21.850 --> 34:22.409
Well...

34:24.409 --> 34:27.690
-Well...
-Well…

34:45.290 --> 34:46.630
Is anyone home?

34:47.560 --> 34:48.370
Lili!

34:48.850 --> 34:50.219
You're here!

34:50.639 --> 34:51.600
Hello.

34:52.370 --> 34:53.370
Hello.

34:54.520 --> 34:55.560
How's everything going?

34:55.560 --> 34:56.409
Pretty good.

34:57.520 --> 34:58.330
Grandma.

34:58.600 --> 34:59.930
Why are you here again?

35:00.000 --> 35:01.370
Is Director Wang back?

35:01.370 --> 35:02.410
-Did he agree to meet us?
-Dad!

35:02.410 --> 35:03.730
They're here!

35:14.290 --> 35:15.150
Director Wang.

35:16.410 --> 35:17.270
Director Wang.

35:18.730 --> 35:19.930
What else do you need?

35:22.290 --> 35:23.290
Here's the thing.

35:23.410 --> 35:23.890
We know

35:23.890 --> 35:25.210
someone deliberately set up

35:25.210 --> 35:27.120
the furniture factory
to get the land for Phase II.

35:27.120 --> 35:28.440
But we need some evidence

35:28.440 --> 35:30.100
to help you uncover the truth.

35:33.730 --> 35:35.210
What my dad means is that

35:35.410 --> 35:37.080
why didn't you come with

35:37.080 --> 35:38.810
that other guy from last night?

35:39.930 --> 35:40.640
Other guy?

35:40.810 --> 35:41.930
What other guy

35:43.960 --> 35:45.370
Wasn't the guy

35:46.040 --> 35:47.640
who came last night with you?

35:49.290 --> 35:51.120
I already gave him all the evidence

35:51.120 --> 35:52.980
I had about the land acquisition.

35:56.120 --> 35:57.440
Do you know his name?

36:10.560 --> 36:11.480
You are...

36:12.370 --> 36:13.480
Is this Director Wang's house?

36:13.480 --> 36:14.610
My name is Jiang Yan.

36:15.330 --> 36:16.040
This is a small gift

36:16.040 --> 36:16.850
-for you.
-No.

36:17.000 --> 36:17.440
No.

36:19.560 --> 36:20.520
Don't be afraid.

36:21.160 --> 36:22.080
I'm here to help you

36:22.080 --> 36:23.340
with the factory case.

36:24.960 --> 36:26.930
Yinshan Furniture Factory
was forced to shut down

36:26.930 --> 36:28.330
because of problems with the distributor,

36:28.330 --> 36:28.850
right?

36:29.250 --> 36:31.040
I've handled similar cases before.

36:31.040 --> 36:32.370
I know how to help you.

36:33.560 --> 36:34.440
Thank you,

36:34.440 --> 36:35.290
Sir.

36:35.560 --> 36:36.480
But someone's

36:36.480 --> 36:37.610
already helping us.

36:38.600 --> 36:39.520
Someone?

36:40.600 --> 36:42.520
Would you mind telling me who?

36:43.810 --> 36:45.040
Wan

36:45.080 --> 36:47.520
and Xixiao.

36:50.730 --> 36:51.770
What a coincidence.

36:51.770 --> 36:52.930
We're together.

36:53.440 --> 36:54.900
You can rest easy now.

36:55.080 --> 36:56.040
I didn't expect them to be even more

36:56.040 --> 36:57.900
anxious about your case than I am.

36:59.290 --> 37:00.710
Is Director Wang home?

37:02.690 --> 37:03.560
Yongli!

37:04.850 --> 37:05.690
Yongli!

37:15.310 --> 37:16.510
A guy surnamed Jiang.

37:17.520 --> 37:18.250
Isn't he

37:18.250 --> 37:19.110
with you?

37:21.810 --> 37:22.770
We know him.

37:23.040 --> 37:23.690
But he's

37:23.690 --> 37:25.550
-not with...
-I asked him to come.

37:26.600 --> 37:27.560
He's a colleague

37:27.560 --> 37:28.890
of ours from years back.

37:29.480 --> 37:31.120
Don't worry.

37:32.120 --> 37:34.620
Whatever you wanted,

37:35.210 --> 37:36.810
I've already given it to him.

37:37.480 --> 37:38.330
Miss Zhou,

37:39.250 --> 37:41.120
I'm not hoping for my factory

37:41.770 --> 37:43.080
to recover anymore.

37:43.850 --> 37:46.650
I just want to pay off the debts
as soon as possible.

37:48.480 --> 37:50.730
I don’t want my Lili

37:51.210 --> 37:52.670
to live like this anymore.

38:02.370 --> 38:03.210
I understand.

38:08.600 --> 38:10.000
I'll do everything I can.

38:11.160 --> 38:12.850
Thank you, Wan.

38:17.560 --> 38:18.410
Excuse me.

38:30.500 --> 38:33.800
[Jiang Yan]
[Lan Yue Yunqilu Resort]

38:33.000 --> 38:34.560
Zhou Wan, let's talk.

38:34.560 --> 38:35.560
Just the two of us.

38:44.440 --> 38:45.640
Then we'll leave now.

38:46.850 --> 38:48.310
Sorry for disturbing you.

38:48.480 --> 38:49.520
Goodbye.

38:50.560 --> 38:51.510
Study hard.

38:51.540 --> 38:52.120
See you.

39:10.120 --> 39:11.580
If I didn't know the truth,

39:12.330 --> 39:13.370
this view

39:13.810 --> 39:15.340
would be really beautiful.

39:16.250 --> 39:18.110
It wasn't this beautiful before.

39:19.290 --> 39:21.150
Over there used to be the factory.

39:21.410 --> 39:22.890
Here was an open field.

39:23.640 --> 39:24.690
My dad taught me

39:24.690 --> 39:26.290
how to ride a bike right here.

39:29.520 --> 39:31.120
Back then he told me

39:32.370 --> 39:33.850
things would get better,

39:35.040 --> 39:36.770
and he'd move us into a bigger,

39:37.040 --> 39:38.290
better house.

39:41.160 --> 39:42.620
I didn't understand then.

39:43.600 --> 39:44.600
I just thought

39:45.000 --> 39:46.200
living with Mom, Dad,

39:46.480 --> 39:48.000
and Grandma was happy

39:49.410 --> 39:50.370
enough.

39:56.690 --> 39:57.890
A simple wish.

39:59.000 --> 40:00.600
But it can never come true.

40:04.730 --> 40:06.040
I've looked through the materials

40:06.040 --> 40:07.300
Director Wang gave me.

40:08.290 --> 40:09.410
There's

40:09.520 --> 40:11.920
accounting records with the distributor,

40:12.290 --> 40:13.210
chat logs,

40:13.480 --> 40:14.560
and recent evidence of

40:14.560 --> 40:15.520
the distributor's

40:15.520 --> 40:17.520
private dealings with Lu Zhongyue.

40:18.560 --> 40:19.640
Unfortunately,

40:20.850 --> 40:21.960
it's not the same

40:22.330 --> 40:23.730
distributor who caused

40:23.730 --> 40:25.160
your father's factory

40:25.480 --> 40:26.520
to shut down.

40:30.600 --> 40:31.930
So I was right.

40:34.690 --> 40:35.410
You went to

40:35.410 --> 40:36.370
Director Wang after finding out

40:36.370 --> 40:37.700
about my father's case.

40:40.040 --> 40:41.000
How did you know?

40:43.160 --> 40:45.290
With the title of Strategic Director,

40:45.330 --> 40:46.860
it's not hard to look up

40:47.330 --> 40:48.590
the Phase I materials.

40:57.600 --> 40:59.400
Besides Director Wang's stuff,

41:00.690 --> 41:01.850
I also found some

41:01.850 --> 41:04.310
evidence of irregularities in the project.

41:07.610 --> 41:08.100
[Detailed Account Transactions between]

41:08.100 --> 41:08.790
[Hengtong Raw Material Supply Co., Ltd.
and Lan Yue Group]

41:08.210 --> 41:08.850
Zhou Wan.

41:09.040 --> 41:10.220
[Detailed Account Transactions between]

41:10.220 --> 41:11.220
[Hengtong Raw Material Supply Co., Ltd.
and Lan Yue Group]

41:10.690 --> 41:12.080
What Lu Xixiao can do,

41:12.640 --> 41:13.560
I can do.

41:14.330 --> 41:15.440
What he can't,

41:16.040 --> 41:17.120
I can too.

41:19.460 --> 41:20.330
I can help you

41:20.330 --> 41:21.460
expose Lu Zhongyue.

41:22.480 --> 41:24.080
I can give you a better life.

41:27.210 --> 41:28.600
Come back to me, okay?

41:29.850 --> 41:31.120
Just like when we were kids.
